### 3. Enable the Delete Button for Rejected Requests (VoucherPostingStatus.js ONLY)
Currently, your isBatchDeletable variable only allows deletions if the batch is PENDING or P. We need to add REJECTED and R to that logic so the Maker can delete a dead workflow.
In **VoucherPostingStatus.js**, find the isBatchDeletable variable declaration (around line 590) and replace it with this:
```javascript
